An artifact opening a frontmatter block it never closes cannot be parsed, and the run refuses rather
than treating the file as body-only. The parser's own wording after the colon is wildcarded — the
contract is the refusal and the file it names, not the exception text.

-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plan/index.md --
---
sessions:
- s-one
-- cmd --
booping session-stats vault/plan/index.md --dry-run
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: cannot read frontmatter of vault/plan/index.md: [..]
